            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 6.2</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">New</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Gemini Omni Flash 1.2.</b> Google's updated video model replaces 1.1: clips of up to 15 seconds, reference videos of up to 15 seconds, and lower prices.</li>
<li><b>Extend a video.</b> With a single source video, Gemini Omni can now continue the clip by 3 to 10 seconds. Only the new seconds are billed.</li>
<li><b>Omni Flash Upscale.</b> A new video upscaler in the Enhancer brings clips of up to 15 seconds to 720p, 1080p or 4K, with the audio kept.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
